    <article class=3D"markdown-body entry-content container-lg" itemprop=3D=
"text"><h1 dir=3D"auto"><a id=3D"user-content-hands-on-crc-checksum-generat=
ion" class=3D"anchor" aria-hidden=3D"true" href=3D"https://github.com/ethan=
huanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/hands-on/06_F746-DISCO-CRC=
/README.md#hands-on-crc-checksum-generation"><svg class=3D"octicon octicon-=
link" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria=
-hidden=3D"true"><path fill-rule=3D"evenodd" d=3D"M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001=
.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1=
.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.6=
9 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0=
 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-=
1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Hands-on: CRC Checksum Generat=
ion</h1>
<h3 dir=3D"auto"><a id=3D"user-content-introduction" class=3D"anchor" aria-=
hidden=3D"true" href=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Work=
shop-2019/blob/master/hands-on/06_F746-DISCO-CRC/README.md#introduction"><s=
vg class=3D"octicon octicon-link" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1.1" wid=
th=3D"16" height=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path fill-rule=3D"evenodd" d=
=3D"M7.775 3.275a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a=
2 2 0 01-2.83 0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 =
00-4.95-4.95l-1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .=
75.75 0 001.06-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25=
-1.25a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>I=
ntroduction</h3>
<p dir=3D"auto">IAR EWARM provides a way to generate checksum as shown belo=
w:
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_00_ewarm-crc.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32Cube=
IDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_00_ewarm-crc.png" alt=3D=
"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
<p dir=3D"auto">How can this be done by using STM32CubeIDE? This hands-on p=
rovides an option for you.</p>
<h3 dir=3D"auto"><a id=3D"user-content-steps" class=3D"anchor" aria-hidden=
=3D"true" href=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2=
019/blob/master/hands-on/06_F746-DISCO-CRC/README.md#steps"><svg class=3D"o=
cticon octicon-link" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" version=3D"1.1" width=3D"16" hei=
ght=3D"16" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path fill-rule=3D"evenodd" d=3D"M7.775 3.2=
75a.75.75 0 001.06 1.06l1.25-1.25a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-2.5 2.5a2 2 0 01-2.83 =
0 .75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06 3.5 3.5 0 004.95 0l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95-4.95l-=
1.25 1.25zm-4.69 9.64a2 2 0 010-2.83l2.5-2.5a2 2 0 012.83 0 .75.75 0 001.06=
-1.06 3.5 3.5 0 00-4.95 0l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 004.95 4.95l1.25-1.25a.75.75 0=
 00-1.06-1.06l-1.25 1.25a2 2 0 01-2.83 0z"></path></svg></a>Steps</h3>
<ol dir=3D"auto">
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Import the reference project.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Build Project</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Start Debug session and check result from serial port conso=
le as shown below:<br>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_00_crc-test.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeI=
DE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_00_crc-test.png" alt=3D""=
 style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>CRC generated by CRC unit in STM32F746 is 0x872D0D45.</li>
<li>CRC generated by CRC code running over STM32F746 is also 0x872D0D45.</l=
i>
<li>Checksum stored in the last word of the first sector is 0xFFFFFFFF whic=
h is not aligned with that generated by CRC unit and therefore CRC check fa=
ils. This is expected since we have not put any checksum into the HEX/BIN f=
ile yet.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><a href=3D"http://srecord.sourceforge.net/download.html" re=
l=3D"nofollow">Srec_cat</a> could be used to generate CRC checksum and put =
it into HEX file. To simplify the process, please put srec_cat.exe into the=
 root of project folder.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Right click on project icon and then select "Properties":<b=
r>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_01_properties.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32Cub=
eIDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_01_properties.png" alt=
=3D"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Type "..\checksum.bat" in Command of Post-build steps:<br>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_02_post-build.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32Cub=
eIDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_02_post-build.png" alt=
=3D"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">"Clean Project" and then "Build Project" again and we can s=
ee checksum.bat executes correctly without error:<br>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_03_rebuild.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeID=
E-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_03_rebuild.png" alt=3D"" s=
tyle=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Check files under "Debug" folder and <strong>06_F746-DISCO-=
CRC_SRECORD.hex</strong> generated by checksum.bat is found:<br>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_04_check_files.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32Cu=
beIDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_04_check_files.png" al=
t=3D"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Check the last word of 06_F746-DISCO-CRC_SRECORD.hex by STM=
32CubeProgrammer. CRC checksum generated by srec_cat and put in the last wo=
rd of <strong>06_F746-DISCO-CRC_SRECORD.hex</strong> (0x872D9D45) is exactl=
y the same as that by CRC unit of STM32F746 (0x872D9D45).<br>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_05_check-by-programmer.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst=
/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_05_check-by-pr=
ogrammer.png" alt=3D"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">After running the debug session and checking the result in =
serial port console, we still get CRC check failure. And memory address 0x0=
8007FFC which is supposed to have CRC checksum 0x872D9D45 still contains 0x=
FFFFFFFF:<br>
<a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://github.com=
/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_06_2nd-run.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeID=
E-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_06_2nd-run.png" alt=3D"" s=
tyle=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">The reason of this failure is due to the fact that <strong>=
06_F746-DISCO-CRC_SRECORD.hex</strong> (containing CRC checksum) is not pro=
grammed when running debug session. We need to assign 06_F746-DISCO-CRC_SRE=
CORD.hex** (containing CRC checksum) to be programmed instead of original <=
strong>06_F746-DISCO-CRC.elf</strong> (w/o CRC checksum). Please open "Debu=
g Configuration" and make the following change:</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"ht=
tps://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs=
/imgs/hands-on/08_07_modify_debug_config.png"><img src=3D"https://github.co=
m/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/0=
8_07_modify_debug_config.png" alt=3D"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto">Run debug session again and finally get correct expected re=
sult:</p>
<p dir=3D"auto"><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"ht=
tps://github.com/ethanhuanginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/blob/master/docs=
/imgs/hands-on/08_08_final-run.png"><img src=3D"https://github.com/ethanhua=
nginst/STM32CubeIDE-Workshop-2019/raw/master/docs/imgs/hands-on/08_08_final=
-run.png" alt=3D"" style=3D"max-width: 100%;"></a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</article>
  </div>

